#. TRANSLATOR: In-chat error, after a message was deleted from its menu; followed by the reason.
#: ../td-client.cpp:1434
msgid "Cannot delete the message"
msgstr "Die Nachricht kann nicht gelöscht werden"

#. TRANSLATOR: After the text of a message edited where it stands, in Pidgin's conversation window.
#: ../receiving.cpp:1274
msgid "edited"
msgstr "bearbeitet"

#. TRANSLATOR: Item of a message's menu, while the message is being edited in the input field.
#: ../td-client.cpp:1195
msgid "Cancel editing"
msgstr "Bearbeiten abbrechen"

#. TRANSLATOR: In-chat notification, not logged, once editing a message was given up.
#. TRANSLATOR: In-chat notification, not logged, after a message being edited was sent unchanged.
#. TRANSLATOR: In-chat notification, not logged, after the /cancel command.
#: ../td-client.cpp:1413 ../tdlib-purple.cpp:359 ../tdlib-purple.cpp:818
msgid "The message is left as it was."
msgstr "Die Nachricht bleibt unverändert."

#. TRANSLATOR: Error after the /cancel command.
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:814
msgid "No message is being edited."
msgstr "Es wird keine Nachricht bearbeitet."

#. TRANSLATOR: Command description, the initial "cancel" must remain verbatim!
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1094
msgid "cancel: Leave the message being edited as it was"
msgstr "cancel: Die bearbeitete Nachricht unverändert lassen"

#. TRANSLATOR: In-chat notification, not logged. Argument is the time (or date and time) the message was sent at, as the conversation window shows it. "/cancel" must remain verbatim!
#: ../td-client.cpp:1364
#, c++-format
msgid ""
"Editing the message from {}: send it to save the change; Esc or /cancel "
"leaves it as it was."
msgstr "Die Nachricht von {} wird bearbeitet: Senden speichert die Änderung; Esc oder /cancel lässt sie unverändert."

#. TRANSLATOR: Error dialog, secondary content, when the message has been deleted.
#: ../td-client.cpp:1057
msgid "The message has been deleted."
msgstr "Die Nachricht wurde gelöscht."

#. TRANSLATOR: Account settings, key (boolean)
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1313
msgid "Strike out deleted messages in Pidgin, rather than remove them"
msgstr "Gelöschte Nachrichten in Pidgin durchstreichen statt entfernen"

#. TRANSLATOR: Item of an edited message's menu, while its latest edit is shown: removed words put back, and added ones, each on its own color. It shows just the text as it now is.
msgid "Show the latest version"
msgstr "Letzte Version zeigen"

#. TRANSLATOR: Item of an edited message's menu, while just its text as it now is is shown. It shows the latest edit: removed words put back, and added ones, each on its own color.
msgid "Show the latest edit"
msgstr "Letzte Bearbeitung zeigen"

#. TRANSLATOR: Account settings, key (number): days counted back from the conversation's latest message. 0 leaves the conversation window as Pidgin opens it.
msgid "Days of messages to show on opening a conversation, in Pidgin"
msgstr "Tage an Nachrichten, die beim Öffnen einer Unterhaltung in Pidgin gezeigt werden"

#. TRANSLATOR: At the end of a conversation window while it is being filled, followed by a turning character.
msgid "Fetching messages from Telegram"
msgstr "Nachrichten werden von Telegram abgerufen"

#. TRANSLATOR: After the text of a message edited where it stands, in Pidgin's conversation window, when only the formatting of its words (bold, italic and the like) changed.
msgid "formatting edited"
msgstr "Formatierung bearbeitet"

#. TRANSLATOR: Contact and conversation menu item, while deleted messages stay in the conversation window, struck out. It has them removed from now on.
msgid "Remove deleted messages"
msgstr "Gelöschte Nachrichten entfernen"

#. TRANSLATOR: Contact and conversation menu item, while deleted messages are removed from the conversation window. It has them stay, struck out, from now on.
msgid "Keep deleted messages, struck out"
msgstr "Gelöschte Nachrichten durchgestrichen behalten"

msgid "The message from {0} was edited"
msgstr "Die Nachricht von {0} wurde bearbeitet"

msgid "{0} edited the message from {1}"
msgstr "{0} hat die Nachricht von {1} bearbeitet"

msgid "Report the message…"
msgstr "Nachricht melden…"

#, c++-format
msgid "Unblock {}"
msgstr "{} entsperren"

#, c++-format
msgid "Block {}…"
msgstr "{} blockieren…"

#, c++-format
msgid "Cannot block {}"
msgstr "{} kann nicht blockiert werden"

#, c++-format
msgid "Cannot unblock {}"
msgstr "{} kann nicht entsperrt werden"

#, c++-format
msgid "Block {}?"
msgstr "{} blockieren?"

msgid "Block user"
msgstr "Benutzer blockieren"

msgid "They will not be able to write to you or call you."
msgstr "Diese Person kann Ihnen dann weder schreiben noch Sie anrufen."

msgid "_Block"
msgstr "Bl_ockieren"

msgid "Reported to Telegram's moderators."
msgstr "An die Moderatoren von Telegram gemeldet."

msgid "Report"
msgstr "Melden"

msgid "_Next"
msgstr "_Weiter"

msgid "Tell Telegram's moderators more"
msgstr "Erzählen Sie den Moderatoren von Telegram mehr"

msgid "This may be left empty."
msgstr "Dies darf leer bleiben."

msgid "_Report"
msgstr "_Melden"

msgid "Telegram wants messages to go with this report: report one from its menu instead, by right-clicking it."
msgstr "Telegram möchte zu dieser Meldung Nachrichten: Melden Sie stattdessen eine davon über ihr Menü, per Rechtsklick."

msgid "Cannot send the report"
msgstr "Die Meldung kann nicht gesendet werden"

msgid "Report…"
msgstr "Melden…"

#, c++-format
msgid "{} joined Telegram"
msgstr "{} ist jetzt bei Telegram"

#. TRANSLATOR: Error after the /paste command, when xclip fails without saying why.
#, c++-format
msgid "xclip failed, with status {}"
msgstr "xclip ist mit Status {} fehlgeschlagen"

#. TRANSLATOR: Error after the /paste command.
msgid "There are no files or picture on the clipboard."
msgstr "In der Zwischenablage sind weder Dateien noch ein Bild."

#. TRANSLATOR: Command description, the initial "paste" must remain verbatim!
msgid "paste: Attach the files copied to the clipboard, or its picture, to the message being written"
msgstr "paste: Die in die Zwischenablage kopierten Dateien oder ihr Bild an die Nachricht anhängen, die gerade geschrieben wird"

#. TRANSLATOR: In-chat notification, not logged, after /paste. The argument is the pasted things' placeholders, such as [Image#1] or [report.pdf].
#, c++-format
msgid "Pasted {}: write it into the message, where it goes, to send it there."
msgstr "Eingefügt: {}. Schreiben Sie es an der passenden Stelle in die Nachricht, um es dort zu senden."

#. TRANSLATOR: In-chat notification, of a picture or video pasted, in the list after "Pasted". The arguments are its placeholders, the second its file name, such as [Image#1] and [holiday.jpg].
#, c++-format
msgid "{0} (or {1}, as a file)"
msgstr "{0} (oder {1}, als Datei)"

#. TRANSLATOR: Item of the menu of a pasted picture's or video's placeholder, such as [Image#1], in the message being written.
msgid "Send as a file"
msgstr "Als Datei senden"

#. TRANSLATOR: Item of the menu of a pasted video's placeholder by its file name, such as [holiday.mp4], in the message being written.
msgid "Send as a video"
msgstr "Als Video senden"

#. TRANSLATOR: Item of the menu of a pasted picture's placeholder by its file name, such as [holiday.jpg], in the message being written.
msgid "Send as a photo"
msgstr "Als Foto senden"

#. TRANSLATOR: Item of the menu of a pasted thing's placeholder, such as [Image#1] or [report.pdf], in the message being written.
msgid "Remove from the message"
msgstr "Aus der Nachricht entfernen"

#. TRANSLATOR: In-chat error message. The arguments are a pasted file's placeholder, such as [report.pdf#3], and where the file was.
#, c++-format
msgid "The message is not sent: {0} is gone from {1}."
msgstr "Die Nachricht wird nicht gesendet: {0} ist nicht mehr in {1}."

#. TRANSLATOR: Tooltip of a dimmed reaction in a message's menu; it can still be picked.
#: ../td-client.cpp:1091
msgid "Needs Telegram Premium"
msgstr "Erfordert Telegram Premium"

#. TRANSLATOR: In-chat error, after a reaction was picked from a message's menu; followed by the reaction.
#: ../td-client.cpp:1115
msgid "Cannot change the reaction"
msgstr "Die Reaktion kann nicht geändert werden"
